      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "PykeQ",
        "name": "Bone Skewer",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Pyke either stabs an enemy in front of him or pulls an enemy towards him.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Tap:</span> Pyke stabs, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100/150/200/250/300 + (75% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to the first enemy hit, preferring champions. They are then <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 90% for 1 second.<br /><br /><span>Hold: </span>Pyke throws his harpoon, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100/150/200/250/300 + (75% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to the first enemy hit and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Pulling</span> them towards him. They are then <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 90% for 1 second.<br /><br />If Pyke successfully hits an enemy champion or the channel does not complete successfully, 75% of the Mana cost is refunded.",
