        "bodyHtml": "Pyke gains <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Camouflage</span> and <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(45 + (200% Lethality))Move Speed</span> decaying over 5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span> scales with Lethality.<br /><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Camouflaged</span> units cannot be seen unless an enemy champion is inside their detection radius.</span>",
