        "bodyHtml": "Pyke dashes, leaving a drowned phantom behind him that returns to him shortly. The phantom <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stuns</span> for (1.25 + (1% Lethality)) seconds and deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100/150/200/250/300 + (100% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to champions.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stun</span> duration scales with Lethality.</span>",
